  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda Fight Against Hunger and Malnutrition Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Blue Atlas Project is pioneering a project in Fort Portal, Uganda to build a farm with an innovative approach to fighting hunger and malnutrition with a focus on children. The Spirulina Development Insititute  (SDI) is a multi-phase project that will build a sustainable farm which will grow spirulina, a complete nutritional profile. We will be partnering with 5 schools in Fort Portal by building and infusing drinking stations with spirulina to reach more than 1800 students</narrative>
  </description>
